SDL-E1037 (spec/api.md)

  x at most one `any` block is allowed
   ,----
 1 | api '/x' { any { then: 1; }; any { then: 2; }; };
   :                              ^|^
   :                               `-- `any` is already defined
   `----
  help: merge the blocks — `any` is endpoint-wide and appears at most once; SurrealQL folds a repeated `FOR ANY` config-last-wins, which SDL rejects as ambiguous
